        "update": {
          "help": "Update an existing invoice. --line-amount LINEID=AMOUNT sets that line's unit_cost (quantity unchanged). Find line IDs with `invoicedesk invoice get <id>`. InvoiceDesk replaces the whole lines array on update, so the invoice is fetched and every line is resent; lines not named are preserved. An unknown line ID or a non-numeric/non-positive amount fails with a non-zero exit and nothing is sent. With --line-amount the output JSON also includes the invoice lines.",
          "examples": [
            "invoicedesk invoice update 1234567 -f ./contract.pdf",
            "invoicedesk invoice update 1234567 -n \"Updated notes\"",
            "invoicedesk invoice update 1234567 -f ./receipt.pdf -n \"Added receipt\"",
            "invoicedesk invoice update 1234567 --terms-from-config",
